        Uncovering Brain-Like Hierarchical Patterns in Vision-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span> through fMRI-Based Neural Encoding
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Ren%2C+Y">Yudan Ren</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Wang%2C+X">Xinlong Wang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Wang%2C+K">Kexin Wang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Xia%2C+T">Tian Xia</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Ma%2C+Z">Zihan Ma</a>, 
      
