    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Mixed-Precision Quantization for <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span>: Techniques and Prospects
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Rakka%2C+M">Mariam Rakka</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Fournarakis%2C+M">Marios Fournarakis</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Krestinskaya%2C+O">Olga Krestinskaya</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Bazzi%2C+J">Jinane Bazzi</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Salama%2C+K+N">Khaled N. Salama</a>, 
      
