    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Fine-tuning of Large <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span> for Constituency Parsing Using a Sequence to Sequence Approach
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Delgado%2C+F+J+C">Francisco Jose Cortes Delgado</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Gracia%2C+E+M">Eduardo Martinez Gracia</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Garcia%2C+R+V">Rafael Valencia Garcia</a>
      
